{"seq":1,"slug":"mvc-mvp-mvvm","title":"MVC、MVP 与 MVVM 的演进","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/foundations/mvc-mvp-mvvm","wordCount":1425,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"mvc-mvp-与-mvvm-的演进\">MVC、MVP 与 MVVM 的演进</h1><p>移动端表现层架构的三十年演进史可以用一句话概括：不断将&quot;决定 UI 长什么样&quot;的逻辑从视图层剥离出来，放到一个更容易测试、更容易复用的中间层。MVC 把逻辑放进 Controller，MVP 把逻辑放进 Presenter，MVVM 把逻辑放进 ViewModel。三者的分野不在&quot;有没有分层&quot;，而在 View 与逻辑层之间的通信契约——命令式调用、接口回调、还是数据绑定。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>关注点分离</strong>：将数据（Model）、展示（View）、逻辑（Controller/Presenter/ViewModel）拆到不同角色</li>\n<li><strong>通信契约</strong>：三种模式的本质区别在于逻辑层与 View 之间采用命令式调用、接口回调还是数据流订阅</li>\n<li><strong>状态转换函数</strong>：所有表现层模式都可抽象为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f: (State, Event) \\rightarrow State&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，差异在于 State 的显式程度和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 的集中程度</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"mvc-起源与移动端变体\">MVC：起源与移动端变体</h2><p>Model-View-Controller 最早出现在 1979 年 Smalltalk-80 的 GUI 框架中。经典 MVC 的三角关系是：View 观察 Model 变化并自动刷新；用户操作发给 Controller；Controller 修改 Model。但移动端的 MVC 实现与经典版本差异巨大。</p>\n<p>Apple 的 Cocoa MVC（UIKit 时代）将 View 和 Controller 紧密绑定——<code>UIViewController</code> 同时承担视图生命周期管理和业务逻辑协调，导致所谓 Massive View Controller 问题。Android 早期的 Activity/Fragment 同样扮演了类似角色。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// iOS UIKit 时代的典型 &quot;Massive View Controller&quot;&#10;class OrderListViewController: UIViewController, UITableViewDataSource {&#10;    var orders: [Order] = []&#10;&#10;    override func viewDidLoad() {&#10;        super.viewDidLoad()&#10;        fetchOrders() // 网络请求&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func fetchOrders() {&#10;        APIClient.shared.getOrders { [weak self] result in&#10;            self?.orders = result&#10;            self?.tableView.reloadData() // 直接操作 UI&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    func tableView(_ tableView: UITableView, numberOfRowsInSection section: Int) -&gt; Int {&#10;        orders.count // 数据源逻辑也在这里&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// iOS UIKit 时代的典型 \"Massive View Controller\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderListViewController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UIViewController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">UITableViewDataSource </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders: [Order] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    override</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> viewDidLoad</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">viewDidLoad</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        fetchOrders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 网络请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchOrders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        APIClient.shared.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">getOrders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">weak</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.orders </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            self</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tableView.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">reloadData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 直接操作 UI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> tableView</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">_</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tableView: UITableView, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">numberOfRowsInSection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> section: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        orders.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 数据源逻辑也在这里</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>经典 MVC</th>\n<th>Apple Cocoa MVC</th>\n<th>Android Activity MVC</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Controller 职责</td>\n<td>仅转发用户输入</td>\n<td>视图生命周期 + 业务逻辑</td>\n<td>同左</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>View-Model 通信</td>\n<td>Observer 直连</td>\n<td>通过 Controller 中转</td>\n<td>通过 Activity 中转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可测试性</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低（Controller 依赖 UIKit）</td>\n<td>低（依赖 Android Framework）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型文件行数</td>\n<td>50-100</td>\n<td>500-2000</td>\n<td>300-1500</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>MVC 的核心问题不是模式本身，而是移动平台的 SDK 设计将 View 和 Controller 耦合为一体，使 Controller 膨胀成无法测试的&quot;上帝对象&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"mvp-接口契约带来的可测试性\">MVP：接口契约带来的可测试性</h2><p>Model-View-Presenter 的关键改进是引入一个<strong>接口契约</strong>：View 通过协议/接口暴露自己的能力（<code>showLoading()</code>、<code>displayOrders([Order])</code>），Presenter 通过这个接口驱动 View，而不持有 View 的具体类型。这使 Presenter 可以在纯单元测试中用 Mock View 验证逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Android MVP 示例&#10;interface OrderListView {&#10;    fun showLoading()&#10;    fun hideLoading()&#10;    fun displayOrders(orders: List&lt;Order&gt;)&#10;    fun showError(message: String)&#10;}&#10;&#10;class OrderListPresenter(&#10;    private val view: OrderListView,&#10;    private val repository: OrderRepository&#10;) {&#10;    fun loadOrders() {&#10;        view.showLoading()&#10;        repository.getOrders(&#10;            onSuccess = { orders -&gt;&#10;                view.hideLoading()&#10;                view.displayOrders(orders)&#10;            },&#10;            onError = { error -&gt;&#10;                view.hideLoading()&#10;                view.showError(error.message)&#10;            }&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Android MVP 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface OrderListView {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun showLoading()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun hideLoading()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun displayOrders(orders: List&#x3C;Order>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun showError(message: String)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class OrderListPresenter(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val view: OrderListView,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository: OrderRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loadOrders() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        view.showLoading()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        repository.getOrders(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onSuccess = { orders -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                view.hideLoading()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                view.displayOrders(orders)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            onError = { error -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                view.hideLoading()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                view.showError(error.message)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MVP 在 2015-2018 年的 Android 社区大量流行（Google 官方 Architecture Blueprints 最初版本即基于 MVP）。其局限在于：每个 View 需要一个对应的接口，随着屏幕复杂度增长，接口方法膨胀；Presenter 持有 View 引用带来生命周期管理负担。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant U as 用户&#10;    participant V as View&#10;    participant P as Presenter&#10;    participant M as Model/Repository&#10;&#10;    U-&gt;&gt;V: 点击&quot;刷新&quot;&#10;    V-&gt;&gt;P: loadOrders()&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;V: showLoading()&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;M: getOrders()&#10;    M--&gt;&gt;P: List&lt;Order&gt;&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;V: hideLoading()&#10;    P-&gt;&gt;V: displayOrders(orders)\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant U as 用户\n    participant V as View\n    participant P as Presenter\n    participant M as Model/Repository\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;V: 点击\"刷新\"\n    V-&gt;&gt;P: loadOrders()\n    P-&gt;&gt;V: showLoading()\n    P-&gt;&gt;M: getOrders()\n    M--&gt;&gt;P: List&lt;Order&gt;\n    P-&gt;&gt;V: hideLoading()\n    P-&gt;&gt;V: displayOrders(orders)</pre><h2 id=\"mvvm-数据绑定与响应式革命\">MVVM：数据绑定与响应式革命</h2><p>Model-View-ViewModel 将 Presenter 的&quot;命令式调用 View 方法&quot;替换为&quot;暴露可观察的数据流&quot;。View 订阅 ViewModel 的数据流，当数据变化时 UI 自动更新。这消除了 View 接口，也消除了 ViewModel 对 View 的直接引用——ViewModel 完全不知道 View 的存在。</p>\n<p>在 iOS 端，MVVM 随 Combine（2019）和 SwiftUI（2019）成为事实标准。在 Android 端，Jetpack ViewModel + LiveData/StateFlow + Jetpack Compose 构成了 Google 官方推荐的架构模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"// Android Jetpack Compose + ViewModel（2026 标准写法）&#10;class OrderListViewModel(&#10;    private val repository: OrderRepository&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow(OrderListState())&#10;    val uiState: StateFlow&lt;OrderListState&gt; = _uiState.asStateFlow()&#10;&#10;    fun loadOrders() {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = true) }&#10;            repository.getOrders()&#10;                .onSuccess { orders -&gt;&#10;                    _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = false, orders = orders) }&#10;                }&#10;                .onFailure { error -&gt;&#10;                    _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = false, error = error.message) }&#10;                }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;data class OrderListState(&#10;    val isLoading: Boolean = false,&#10;    val orders: List&lt;Order&gt; = emptyList(),&#10;    val error: String? = null&#10;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// Android Jetpack Compose + ViewModel（2026 标准写法）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class OrderListViewModel(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val repository: OrderRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _uiState = MutableStateFlow(OrderListState())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val uiState: StateFlow&#x3C;OrderListState> = _uiState.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun loadOrders() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = true) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            repository.getOrders()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .onSuccess { orders -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = false, orders = orders) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                .onFailure { error -></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    _uiState.update { it.copy(isLoading = false, error = error.message) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data class OrderListState(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val isLoading: Boolean = false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val orders: List&#x3C;Order> = emptyList(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val error: String? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>MVP</th>\n<th>MVVM</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>View→逻辑层通信</td>\n<td>方法调用</td>\n<td>方法调用（触发 Intent/Action）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑层→View 通信</td>\n<td>接口回调</td>\n<td>数据流订阅（被动）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>View 接口</td>\n<td>必须定义</td>\n<td>不需要</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逻辑层持有 View 引用</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生命周期感知</td>\n<td>手动管理</td>\n<td>框架支持（Jetpack ViewModel / SwiftUI）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态一致性</td>\n<td>多方法调用可能产生中间态</td>\n<td>单一状态对象避免不一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三者的数学本质-状态转换函数\">三者的数学本质：状态转换函数</h2><p>从函数式视角看，三种模式的核心区别在于<strong>状态转换的表达方式</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>E</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f: (State, Event) \\rightarrow State&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><strong>MVC</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 散落在 Controller 的各个方法中，State 是隐式的（分散在多个变量）</li>\n<li><strong>MVP</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 集中在 Presenter 中，但输出通过命令式调用（<code>view.show()</code>）而非新 State</li>\n<li><strong>MVVM</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 集中在 ViewModel 中，输出是一个新的 State 对象，View 通过订阅自动映射</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当你把 State 显式化、把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span></span> 纯函数化，就自然走向了<a href=\"unidirectional-data-flow\">单向数据流架构</a>——这也是为什么 MVVM 被视为通往 MVI/Redux 的桥梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型决策树\">选型决策树</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[项目规模与团队] --&gt; B{团队 &lt; 3人 &amp; 功能 &lt; 20 屏?}&#10;    B --&gt;|是| C[MVVM 足够]&#10;    B --&gt;|否| D{需要时间旅行调试/严格状态追踪?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[MVI/Redux/TCA]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F{遗留 UIKit/Activity 代码占比 &gt; 60%?}&#10;    F --&gt;|是| G[MVP 作为过渡]&#10;    F --&gt;|否| H[MVVM + 单一状态对象]\">flowchart TD\n    A[项目规模与团队] --&gt; B{团队 &lt; 3人 &amp; 功能 &lt; 20 屏?}\n    B --&gt;|是| C[MVVM 足够]\n    B --&gt;|否| D{需要时间旅行调试/严格状态追踪?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[MVI/Redux/TCA]\n    D --&gt;|否| F{遗留 UIKit/Activity 代码占比 &gt; 60%?}\n    F --&gt;|是| G[MVP 作为过渡]\n    F --&gt;|否| H[MVVM + 单一状态对象]</pre><p>做选型时避免两个常见错误：第一，为简单应用引入过重的架构（如 3 个页面的工具类 app 用 Clean Architecture + MVI 四层）；第二，把&quot;我熟悉的模式&quot;等同于&quot;适合当前项目的模式&quot;。架构服务于约束——团队规模、测试要求、代码寿命、迭代节奏——而非个人偏好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从-mvvm-到更严格约束的过渡\">从 MVVM 到更严格约束的过渡</h2><p>MVVM 解决了可测试性和 View-逻辑解耦问题，但它没有规定：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>副作用如何管理</strong>——网络请求、数据库写入放在 ViewModel 哪里？怎么取消？</li>\n<li><strong>状态如何组合</strong>——多个子 Feature 的状态怎么聚合成一个屏幕状态？</li>\n<li><strong>模块间如何通信</strong>——ViewModel A 需要 ViewModel B 的数据时怎么办？</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这三个遗留问题正是下一篇 <a href=\"clean-architecture-mobile\">Clean Architecture 移动端</a> 和后续章节要解决的。Clean Architecture 回答问题 1（将副作用推到 Data 层），TCA/MVI 回答问题 2（Reducer 组合），模块化策略回答问题 3（模块间接口契约）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>MVC → MVP → MVVM 的演进轨迹是一条逐步增强可测试性、逐步减少 View 与逻辑层耦合的路径。MVC 在移动平台因 SDK 设计而退化为 Massive Controller；MVP 通过接口契约恢复了可测试性但引入了样板代码；MVVM 通过数据流订阅彻底消除了逻辑层对 View 的感知。三者不是互斥的&quot;代际替代&quot;——在同一个大型应用中，简单页面用 MVVM、复杂页面用 MVI、遗留页面保持 MVP 是完全合理的渐进策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"MVC、MVP 与 MVVM 的演进","id":"mvc-mvp-与-mvvm-的演进"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MVC：起源与移动端变体","id":"mvc-起源与移动端变体"},{"level":2,"text":"MVP：接口契约带来的可测试性","id":"mvp-接口契约带来的可测试性"},{"level":2,"text":"MVVM：数据绑定与响应式革命","id":"mvvm-数据绑定与响应式革命"},{"level":2,"text":"三者的数学本质：状态转换函数","id":"三者的数学本质-状态转换函数"},{"level":2,"text":"选型决策树","id":"选型决策树"},{"level":2,"text":"从 MVVM 到更严格约束的过渡","id":"从-mvvm-到更严格约束的过渡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"Clean Architecture 移动端实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/foundations/clean-architecture-mobile"}}